


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_92bed41d:



    voice "2HI_1581"
    hina "「哈哈，大买特买呢。这下就万无一失了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_7152c4ca:



    voice "2RI_1619"
    rin "「阳菜想得这么远让我都笑不出来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_30c2e865:



    voice "2HI_1582"
    hina "「毕竟这都是为了浅生对吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_aa3a4c89:



    voice "2RI_1620"
    rin "「嗯……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_7e1abde3:



    voice "2HI_1583"
    hina "「我回来了～咦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_686ee907:



    voice "2RI_1621"
    rin "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_5a8a48db:


    "阳菜和伦打开门后，迎接她们的是祥子和……"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_6a41404e:



    voice "2FU_1204"
    fumi "「欢迎回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_c97d549b:


    "文一如既往地露出和蔼的微笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_5c9b09c5:



    voice "2RI_1622"
    rin "「……我回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_8a23e598:


    "伦差一点就抑制不住自己飞扑上去的欲望了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_e0e975d7:



    voice "2RI_1623"
    rin "「……还穿着校服？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_d934d2ec:



    voice "2FU_1205"
    fumi "「咦，购物袋？你们绕到哪里去了呀？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_ce4b6570:


    "伦那细若蚕丝的说话声还没传到文那边，就被文提问时的声音给盖过去了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_fb39e542:



    voice "2RI_1624"
    rin "「嗯，稍微收拾一下」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_0d04b9e7:



    voice "2FU_1206"
    fumi "「好多袋子呢。你们都买了些什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_29c0366c:



    voice "2HI_1584"
    hina "「嗯，这个是日程记录本，这边的是墨镜，然后这边的则是口罩还有……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_5915f89a:



    voice "2FU_1207"
    fumi "「嗯？总感觉是奇怪的组合呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_b8df7137:



    voice "2SA_0873"
    sachiko "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_563e8ba6:



    voice "2HI_1585"
    hina "「嘿嘿」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_21603ee7:


    "祥子像是一脸顿悟地看着阳菜的表情。阳菜也以恶作剧般的微笑来回应祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_0b6f757a:



    voice "2RI_1625"
    rin "「那个……因为，我打算成为，文的第一个粉丝」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_17fa508b:


    "伦出尽全力地挤出了僵硬的笑容。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_e98cf159:



    voice "2FU_1208RE"
    fumi "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_95ff29d6:



    voice "2RI_1626"
    rin "「我又不像文那样可爱所以根本就没法站在一起嘛。但是给文加油或是帮忙的话我还是做得到的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_f9270531:



    voice "2FU_1209RE"
    fumi "「诶？诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_8ccf16de:


    "伦没有理会懵在一边的文而是继续说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_bfa69eab:



    voice "2RI_1627"
    rin "「等毕业之后我也要到文所在的事务所里工作。那样就可以成为文的经纪人来作后勤支援。之前那个未来就业志愿上我也是那样写的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_a1c142a5:



    voice "2RI_1628"
    rin "「其实我本来想现在就申请退学然后赶上你的。不过又不符合事务所的应聘条件所以就……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_4c951db9:



    voice "2FU_1210RE"
    fumi "「那个……伦你稍微等一下？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_6a9b7771:



    voice "2RI_1629"
    rin "「等我哦。我一定会赶上你，成为一个能配得上你的人。所以呢，无论文想去什么地方都尽管去吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_61472d48:



    voice "2FU_1211RE"
    fumi "「……我哪里都不去」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_4768d393:


    "文的笑容似乎在逐渐消失。不知是否因为她在抑制着自己的情感，声线显得有点颤动。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_9a422a2a:



    voice "2FU_1212RE"
    fumi "「也不会到事务所那里去」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_b0cb72ab:



    voice "2RI_1630"
    rin "「哎？可是你今天不是去参加试镜了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_26263455:


    "文只是不做声地摇了摇头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_740dd7ff:



    voice "2RI_1631"
    rin "「我听你父亲说你去了美容院……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_7c428506:



    voice "2FU_1213RE"
    fumi "「美容院？我去的是医院。今早我妈妈突然发烧病倒了所以就过去了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_1e917b0e:



    voice "2SA_0874"
    sachiko "「美容院（びよういん）和医院（びょういん）……今时今日，这种老套的误解还能算数吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_3d5a1854:



    voice "2HI_1586"
    hina "「我觉得不行……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_4e10e764:



    voice "2FU_1214RE"
    fumi "「带我妈妈去了医院，然后又得回店里招呼客人，已经忙得焦头烂额了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_dc3d29e3:



    voice "2RI_1632"
    rin "「所以才穿着校服吗。不过电话打不通又是什么原因……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_2c0dd45d:



    voice "2FU_1215RE"
    fumi "「那个真的很抱歉。因为我的手机没电了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_3a9e92f2:



    voice "2RI_1633"
    rin "「那个……就是说，咦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_af92a6c9:



    voice "2FU_1216RE"
    fumi "「……！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_a7190008:


    "哽咽的文抱了上去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_fe1135a3:



    voice "2FU_1217RE"
    fumi "「我哪里都不想去！只想一直待在伦的身边！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_c4b14848:



    voice "2RI_1634"
    rin "「文……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_0636ce7e:


    "这次轮到伦懵了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_58a2677f:



    voice "2SA_0875"
    sachiko "「没错啊。不如说真正寂寞难耐的是文才对」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_6e602c26:



    voice "2HI_1587"
    hina "「嗯嗯，文能忍下来真的很棒呢～」"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_7f3b98c6:


    voice "2RI_1628"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_08_8be92dfe:


    rin "「其实我本来想现在就申请退学然后赶上你的。不过又不符合事务所的应聘条件所以就……」"
